config UNISOC_WCN_SDIO
	tristate "Unisoc SC2355 WCN SDIO core"
	depends on MMC && OF
	depends on FW_LOADER
	help
	  Core driver for the external Unisoc SC2355 (Marlin3-Lite)
	  WCN combo attached over SDIO. It provides firmware download,
	  SDIO packet channel transport, runtime reset and platform
	  devices for the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, FM and GNSS functions.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called unisoc-wcn-sdio.
